{"type":"after","callId":"jgqi@4313","endTime":361254.056,"result":{"value":"All projects\nMOBILE EXPERIENCE / 06\nTukeeConnect.\n\nTukeeConnect’s mobile presentation combines conversations, contact discovery, profile information, and call interfaces.\n\nPROJECT TYPE\nMobile apps\nFOCUS\nTeam communication\nORIGINAL PROJECT ARTWORK\nOverview\nKey features\nDesign\nScreenshots\n01\nPROJECT OVERVIEW\nKeep the team conversation close.\n\nThe mobile TukeeConnect designs focus on communication inside a people-oriented workspace. Conversation views sit alongside contact and profile screens, with a call interface included in the original artwork. These mobile layouts complement the organization-management view shown in the web portfolio.\n\n02\nKEY FEATURES\nA closer look at\nthe experience.\n\nThe flows and interface elements visible in TukeeConnect's original project material.\n\n01\nConversation views\n\nMessage bubbles and conversation controls organize written exchanges.\n\n02\nContact discovery\n\nPeople and their profiles appear in dedicated directory views.\n\n03\nCall interface\n\nThe supplied artwork includes a screen for a person-to-person call.\n\n04\nProfile information\n\nA personal profile area introduces identity and account details.\n\n03\nDESIGN DIRECTION\nIts own identity.\nIn every detail.\nTeam communication\n\nBlue provides continuity with the web product, while white message surfaces make conversation content the focus. Rounded avatars and a compact navigation bar support a familiar people-first hierarchy across the supplied screens.\n\nDesign observations from the supplied project artwork.\n04\nUI SCREENSHOTS & ARTWORK\nInside TukeeConnect.\n\nExplore the original interface screens. Select any image for a closer look.\n\nINTERFACE SCREEN\n01\nINTERFACE SCREEN\n02\nINTERFACE SCREEN\n03\nINTERFACE SCREEN\n04\nSOURCE MATERIAL\n\nProject descriptions are based on the published artwork and available overview. Interface observations do not imply verified implementation details or measured business results.\n\nOriginal project page\nNEXT MOBILE PROJECT\nPace of Play\nKEEP EXPLORING\nMore perspectives.\nView all work\nGOLF & COURSE ACTIVITY\nPace of Play\nWORK RECORDS & DOCUMENTS\nQcop App\nFAMILY & DAILY CARE\nLittle Butterflies\nHAVE A PROJECT IN MIND?\nLet's make your\nnext idea real.\nBook a free consultation"}}
